 file must end with all non-ignored tests PASSING.\n5. Write the CONFIGS.md row numbers you covered to `tmpwk/covered_script.txt`\n   (`<row> <test fn>`).\n\nFINAL REPORT: number of test fns, CONFIGS.md rows covered, and FULL detail of every\ndivergence found (exact JS source, C output, Rust output)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01UrTSzcsB8tDakT2p1ypBEu","session_id":"2be16944-0c16-4bac-97a9-ffb5f1a29386","uuid":"69c323d4-1ef1-454f-863b-61140361eac8","timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:01:15.077Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Phase B script-level config tests"}
